{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Preview Consolidation"},"description":"START HERE for agent memory cleanup. Stateless, free, no session or check-in needed. Send a JSON bundle of your memories (or facts), tool schemas, plans and logs; get back a deterministic keep/archive/drop diff with a reason per item, the slimmer result bundle, and before/after token estimates. Use when your context, memory store or tool list has grown long, before starting a new task, or to find duplicate, superseded, expired or cold memories and unused tools. Nothing is stored, rewritten or deleted; no model is called. Free limit 32 KiB. Exclude secrets and personal data.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"bundle":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"Private JSON state. Free: 32 KiB, 100 memories, 30 tools, 30 plans, 200 logs. Luxury: 512 KiB, 1000 memories, 200 tools, 200 plans, 2000 logs. No model calls. Use memories or its facts alias, never both.","not":{"required":["memories","facts"]},"properties":{"facts":{"items":{"additionalProperties":true,"properties":{"expires_at":{"anyOf":[{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},{"description":"Unix epoch milliseconds.","type":"number"}]},"id":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"important":{"type":"boolean"},"protected":{"type":"boolean"},"source":{"type":"string"},"supersedes":{"anyOf":[{"maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},{"items":{"maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"type":"array"}]},"text":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"tier":{"enum":["hot","warm","cold"]},"time":{"anyOf":[{"format":"date-time","type":"string"},{"description":"Unix epoch milliseconds.","type":"number"}]},"use_count":{"minimum":0,"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","text"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":1000,"type":"array"},"logs":{"description":"Normal log entries or reversible log_run entries returned by a prior consolidation. Limit